  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 and transformer aggregation (config_006) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.652970). This experiment tests adding multimodal data (resnet50 image encoder) with the same RNA encoder and transformer aggregation but weighted fusion, isolating the impact of image data integration. It balances exploitation of the best RNA setup with exploration of multimodal potential, which could yield higher accuracy if image data provides complementary information."
